OP the structural advantage in the contest to succeed term-limited Governor Ron DeSantis.\n\nMost expert ratings call the race Lean Republican, and prediction markets price Donalds' chances near four-to-one. Polling averages show Donalds ahead by roughly four to six points, though much of the survey data is older or drawn from hypothetical matchups. Late-October headlines highlight Jolly's outreach to Black and independent voters and surrogate help from Bill Clinton, alongside reporting on Donalds' softness with Latino voters. Those openings keep the race competitive but have not yet erased the Republican edge.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.1709, "margin": -5.38}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.2654, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.2923, "margin": -3.5}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.2636, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.1983, "margin": -4.5}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.2414, "margin": -3.8}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.2597, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.2217, "margin": -4.8}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.2584, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.252, "margin": -4.3}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.2745, "margin": -3.8}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.2552, "margin": -4.2}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.2498, "margin": -4.2}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.2281, "margin": -4.2}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.2329, "margin": -4.2}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.2195, "margin": -4.2}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.2688, "margin": -3.2}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.2284, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.224, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.2571, "margin": -3.5}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.2372, "margin": -4.3}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.2555, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.2213, "margin": -4.5}, {"date": "2026-10-15", "p_dem": 0.1962, "margin": -4.5}, 